Feature: Login Functionality

Background:
Given the user is on the login page
When the user clicks Super Admin button

Scenario: Login with Valid Credentials

And the user clicks the Sign in button
Then the user should be redirected to super admin dashboard


Scenario Outline: Login with invalid credentials

And the user enter invalid "<username>" and valid password
And the user clicks the Sign in button
Then the system should show a message invalid username or password

Examples:
| username         |
| super@gmail.com  |


Scenario: Login with empty field

When the user clicks the Sign in button
Then the system should show a message username field is required and password field is required